WHAT IS PROVEN
  - Byte-exact storage incl. invalid UTF-8, NULs, CR/LF, empty and 1.5 MiB records
  - Tamper matrix: 10 rows, 0 undetected, each naming the offending segment
  - Torn tails cut at EVERY byte offset; exactly the whole records survive
